sball-addition (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: pre/post-quorate hooks, service wrapper, quorate watcher,
    JSON logging, timeouts, retries, RUN_ONCE markers, cluster aware targets
    (local/master/all), CLI, node acceptance checker (sball-node-verify),
    quorum safe cluster rollout (sball-rollout), Prometheus textfile exporter,
    systemd units, sample hooks and the production runbook.

